{
 "unit": "xs-preferences",
 "testfile": "T04",
 "note": "Action verbs (both/orig/fp): open_testfile <T..> (close docs unsaved, open fresh, base settings) / close_all; menu 'A > B'; command <id from commands.json>; panel <window.* id or title>; panel_menu <panel> (open its menu); select <object name|[names]>; select_none; tool <tool id>; open <logical ui key>; click/double_click/right_click/hover/mouse_down/mouse_up <label|{key}|{popup_swatch:#hex}|{area,pos}>; drag {from,to,mods}; canvas_click/canvas_move [x,y] (document px); canvas_drag {from,to,mods}; scroll {area,delta}; key <combo>; type <text>; wait <ms>; choose {target,item} (pick list entry); file_dialog <path> (choose file in open dialog); export_png doc (export + hash); resize_panel {panel,width}; set_field {target,value}; export {dir,name,type,...} (File > Export dialog); clear_dir/record_dir <dir>; record_file <path> (size+hash+pixels); record_file_text <path>; restart_app; resize_dialog {width,height}; target forms {canvas:[x,y]|name}, {pref_category}, {tree_item:[path]}, hold_key in drag/click; log_value <JSF expression, logged in both>; record_ui <logical ui key> (orig window text/UIA, fp ui_find/ui_state); jsf <code> (in both = fp run_script); fp-only ui_action {...}, ui_find_click <text>. Step keys: after = actions after the shot; log_menu_items = item texts + enabled/checked of the open menu; shot omitted = value-only checkpoint.",
